# UI & UX Rules

- Aesthetic: Modern, clean, minimal, native Windows Fluent feel.
- Avoid excessive gradients, heavy glassmorphism, or noisy neon colors.
- Maintain high contrast (minimum 4.5:1 for normal text).
- Always show clear keyboard focus indicators (minimum 2px).
- Support both Dark Theme (`#1E1E1E`) and Light Theme (`#F3F3F3`).
- Transitions must be brief (< 200ms) and respect reduced-motion settings.
- Follow interaction guidelines defined in `docs/ui/interaction-rules.md`.
